    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 1 Cois Teannaire, a beautifully presented three-bed, three-bath semi-detached home, ideally positioned in the heart of Aherla Village, Co. Cork.\nThe combination of generous living accommodation, off street parking, and an enclosed private rear patio & garden; this property is an excellent choice for first-time buyers, growing families, down-sizers or those seeking a well-located investment within easy reach of Cork City.\nEnjoying the charm and community atmosphere of village life, while remaining conveniently connected to surrounding towns, amenities and commuter routes, this property offers an appealing balance of space, privacy and accessibility. \n\n\nHallway (5.85m x 2.49m)\nThe front door opens into a warm and welcoming entrance with linoleum flooring throughout. \n\n\nLiving room (4.85m x 3.51m)\nThe living room is situated at the front of the house and features an attractive open fireplace with a timber mantle piece.\nGuest WC (2.12m x 1.30m) \nThis is a spacious WC with full height celling, linoleum floor & tiled splashback , WCH & WHB. \n\n\nKitchen/Dining (5.53m x 5.06m)\nThe contemporary kitchen is both stylish and functional, featuring sleek cabinetry, with breakfast bar and integrated oven, hob & extractor fan. \nThe dining area opens out to the patio & garden via the glass sliding door. \nThis area is also big enough to incorporate a second living/ playroom space. \n\n\nStairs & Landing (3.78m x 2.18m)\nCarpeted stairs and timber floored landing. The hot press provides convenient shelved storage, while a Stira staircase gives access to a partly floored attic.\n\nMaster Bedroom (3.64m x 3.26m)\nSpacious double bedroom, with timber floors, overlooking the rear garden.\n\nEn-Suite (2.32m x 1.08m)\nRecently renovated En-Suite featuring, tiled floored to ceiling with monochrome marble effect tiles stunning matt black appliances, WC and WHB with vanity unit. \n\nBedroom 2 (3.43m x 3.33m)\nDouble bedroom with timber floors, fitted wardrobes and a front aspect window that provides plenty of light.\n\nBedroom 3 (2.60m x 2.40m) \nSingle bedroom with a front aspect window and fitted shelved storage and timber floors. \n\nFamily Bathroom (2.35m x 2.18m)\nFully tiled bathroom with a 3-piece suite, vanity cabinet with mirror and a rear aspect window. \n\nGarden Details\n\nTo the front, the property benefits from a concrete driveway providing off-street parking for two cars and side access to the rear garden. This home is ideally positioned in the heart of Aherla village. \n\nThe rear garden is laid out in lawn and is enclosed by a combination of fenced and walled in boundaries. The shed provides excellent outdoor storage, while a patio area creates an ideal space for al fresco dining, entertaining, or enjoying summer BBQs. \n\n\nFeatures\n?Spacious kitchen offers room for a second living/play room\n?Newly renovated En-Suite\n?Minutes' drive from Ballincollig and The Ballincollig Regional Park \n?Bus Stop across the road \n?Stira attic access \n\n\nHeating \nOil Central Heating \n"
      },
